 ✅ Correct Setup


Internet
   |
   v
Amazon ALB  (Infra LB)
   |
   v
Spring Cloud Gateway (API Gateway)
   |
   v
Microservices


 Responsibilities Split

| Layer    | Responsibility                         |
| -------- | -------------------------------------- |
| ALB      | TLS, routing, health, traffic shifting |
